            0.124,
            0.525,
            0.748,
            0.585
          ],
          "content": "**5.** Find the number of terms in each of the following APs : (i) 7, 13, 19, . . . , 205 (ii) 18, $1 \\overset { \\circ } { 5 } \\frac { 1 } { 2 }   , 1 3 , \\ldots , - 4 7$"
